And the inhabitants of Madyan. And Moses was denied, so I prolonged enjoyment for the disbelievers; then I seized them, and how [terrible] was My reproach.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"22:45","t":"And how many a city did We destroy while it was committing wrong - so it is [now] fallen into ruin - and [how many] an abandoned well and [how many] a lofty palace.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"22:46","t":"So have they not traveled through the earth and have hearts by which to reason and ears by which to hear? For indeed, it is not eyes that are blinded, but blinded are the hearts which are within the breasts.","j":17,"h":34,"s":22,"a":46,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":34,"surahs":[22],"sajdah":false}